      "start": 702,
      "end": 760,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.8571
    },
    {
      "id": "s006-s006-c5",
      "clipId": "s006",
      "text": "桩底的土，再托住一部分。",
      "start": 768,
      "end": 819,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.8571
    },
    {
      "id": "s006-s006-c6",
      "clipId": "s006",
      "text": "这两条传力路线，",
      "start": 831,
      "end": 864,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.8571
    },
    {
      "id": "s006-s006-c7",
      "clipId": "s006",
      "text": "一起接住上面的重量。",
      "start": 864,
      "end": 908,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.8571
    },
    {
      "id": "v018a-s018-c1",
      "clipId": "v018a",
      "text": "把两边接起来的，",
      "start": 939,
      "end": 982,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9732
    },
    {
      "id": "v018a-s018-c2",
      "clipId": "v018a",
      "text": "是伸臂钢架。",
      "start": 988,
      "end": 1018,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9732
    },
    {
      "id": "v018b-s018-c9",
      "clipId": "v018b",
      "text": "楼一弯，这些连接就把力传到外圈。",
      "start": 1044,
      "end": 1128,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9732
    },
    {
      "id": "v018b-s018-c10",
      "clipId": "v018b",
      "text": "合起来以后，",
      "start": 1143,
      "end": 1169,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9732
    },
    {
      "id": "v018b-s018-c11",
      "clipId": "v018b",
      "text": "这座小钢桥就能把核心筒和外圈柱连在一起。",
      "start": 1176,
      "end": 1275,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9732
    },
    {
      "id": "v029-s029-c4",
      "clipId": "v029",
      "text": "先看表面的平均风压：",
      "start": 1305,
      "end": 1355,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9753
    },
    {
      "id": "v029-s029-c5",
      "clipId": "v029",
      "text": "迎风的一面受到推压，",
      "start": 1364,
      "end": 1409,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9753
    },
    {
      "id": "v029-s029-c6",
      "clipId": "v029",
      "text": "气流绕过转角，",
      "start": 1414,
      "end": 1449,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9753
    },
    {
      "id": "v029-s029-c7",
      "clipId": "v029",
      "text": "侧面和背面的压力也会改变。",
      "start": 1457,
      "end": 1517,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9753
    },
    {
      "id": "v029-s029-c8",
      "clipId": "v029",
      "text": "把颜色贴在表面，",
      "start": 1527,
      "end": 1565,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9753
    },
    {
      "id": "v029-s029-c9",
      "clipId": "v029",
      "text": "就能看见哪一片在被推，",
      "start": 1569,
      "end": 1614,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9753
    },
    {
      "id": "v029-s029-c10",
      "clipId": "v029",
      "text": "哪一片在被向外吸。",
      "start": 1628,
      "end": 1670,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.9753
    },
    {
      "id": "v034-s034-c1",
      "clipId": "v034",
      "text": "楼站得稳，人坐在高处，",
      "start": 1702,
      "end": 1776,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "v034-s034-c2",
      "clipId": "v034",
      "text": "却仍然可能觉得晃。",
      "start": 1778,
      "end": 1818,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s035-s035-c1",
      "clipId": "s035",
      "text": "这位帮手，叫调好频率的质量阻尼器。",
      "start": 1840,
      "end": 1938,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s035-s035-c2",
      "clipId": "s035",
      "text": "上海中心楼顶悬着一块约一千吨的重物，",
      "start": 1950,
      "end": 2039,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s035-s035-c3",
      "clipId": "s035",
      "text": "能相对大楼来回摆动。",
      "start": 2044,
      "end": 2094,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s036-s036-c1",
      "clipId": "s036",
      "text": "气流把大楼推得左右摇，",
      "start": 2132,
      "end": 2197,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s036-s036-c2",
      "clipId": "s036",
      "text": "重物就跟着相对摆动。",
      "start": 2206,
      "end": 2252,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s036-s036-c3",
      "clipId": "s036",
      "text": "把它的节奏调到合适，",
      "start": 2261,
      "end": 2311,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s036-s036-c4",
      "clipId": "s036",
      "text": "就能在运动中牵住大楼，减轻晃动。",
      "start": 2317,
      "end": 2407,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "v047-s047-c4",
      "clipId": "v047",
      "text": "外形越轻盈，",
      "start": 2445,
      "end": 2476,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.961
    },
    {
      "id": "v047-s047-c5",
      "clipId": "v047",
      "text": "里面的配合越精细。",
      "start": 2481,
      "end": 2526,
      "timingSource": "Original source Whisper alignment, translated by integer frames; no rate change",
      "alignmentRatio": 0.961
    }
